orthant 2 release

@ 2 0 0 04344e64d8e0e93c0151bedc6c1ff3a0
+   entry .markup   renders a diagnostic tree as semantic markup: the text `.render` writes, without its colours, with its structure marked
+       A `tree` marker goes around the tree, and a `node` marker around each node's line and
+       its children's, as `delicious.Markup` reads them. Stripped of the markers it is the same
+       text, so a reader of plain text loses nothing. The explaining macro writes this when
+       the compiler runs with `-Zsemantic-diagnostics`.
